      "id": "PR_kwDOKIsnqM8AAAABCP1e5w",
      "title": "Update task 105 106 sep status",
      "author": "Wazabie",
      "number": 1541,
      "body": "Marks sep/105 and sep/106 as EXECUTED with their Sepolia execution transactions.\r\n\r\nThis also carries the CI fix for the red `forge_test` and `template_regression_tests` jobs, which have failed on `main` since this morning with:\r\n\r\n```\r\nerror code -32603: state at block #48340829 is pruned\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe node behind `OP_CI_SEPOLIA_L2_RPC_URL` keeps only a few hours of state. The public `https://sepolia.optimism.io` endpoint does serve historical state, at the current pin and at the July pin 46429711, so the ci profile now uses it, matching what the default profile already uses locally. The pinned blocks are unchanged.",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/superchain-ops",
      "createdAt": "2026-09-04T19:10:07Z",
      "mergedAt": "2026-09-04T20:30:33Z",
